==Trivia==
*The text on its ring is upside-down katakana which translates as: "''A [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Devil]] unbeaten by the rain, unbeaten by the wind, bested by neither snow nor summer heat.''" This is a reference to [[wikipedia:Kenji Miyazawa|Kenji Miyazawa]]'s famous poem ''[[wikipedia:Ame ni mo Makezu|Ame ni mo Makezu]]''.
*Its description mentioned [[The Aku Realms]] before they were added to the game.
*Its blades resemble bat wings, which are commonly depicted as the wings used by certain demons, fitting for this Cyclone being an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]].
*Its damage per hit and minimum money drop are both 6,666, referencing the [[wikipedia:Number of the beast|Number of the Beast]].
**Its health is also a 1 followed by 666,666.
**Its attack frequency is 6f, unlike most other [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s' 5f.
***The other exceptions are [[The Perfect Cyclone]] and [[Primeval Cyclone]], which also have an attack frequency of 6f.
*It has the highest money drop out of all [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclones]], and is the only Cyclone to guarantee a full wallet refill upon its defeat.

